### 0. Force Clear Client Environment Variables & Session Tokens Locally
POST http://localhost/api/stripe/webhook
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "local.cache.flush.trigger"
}

> {%
    // AUTOMATION: Atomic manual wipe of cached client global variables inside PhpStorm memory
    client.global.set("auth_token", "");
    client.global.set("invoice_id", "");

    client.log("Client HTTP memory tokens successfully flushed to null.");
%}

### 1. Login as Owner to Central Admin Panel
POST http://localhost/api/central/v1/login
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{
    "email": "owner@saas.com",
    "password": "password"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("central_token", response.body.token);
%}


### 2. Logout from Central Admin Panel
POST http://localhost/api/v1/logout
Accept: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
Authorization: Bearer {{central_token}}


